OL,3,AUS death row inmate Christa Pike awake
OL,4,Aand speaking after failed execution,
OL,5,Alawyers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS death row inmate Christa Pike is
OL,8,F"conscious and speaking" after
OL,9,Fsurviving a failed execution attempt
OL,10,Flast week, her lawyers say.
OL,12,FPike, 50, continues to receive critical
OL,13,Fmedical care while handcuffed in
OL,14,Fhospital, her attorneys said in a
OL,15,Fstatement on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
