OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS death row inmate Christa Pike awake
OL,4,Aand speaking after failed execution,
OL,5,Alawyers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FPike, who was sentenced to death after
OL,8,Fmurdering Colleen Slemmer in 1995,
OL,9,Fsurvived two failed lethal injections
OL,10,Flast Wednesday in Tennessee. She was
OL,11,Ftaken to hospital, where she remained
OL,12,Funconscious for days as medical staff
OL,13,Fcleared her body of the injected
OL,14,Fchemical.
OL,16,FExperts and her legal team say her
OL,17,Fapparent recovery is unprecedented. She
OL,18,Fis believed to be the only person to
OL,19,Fsurvive a lethal injection.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
